      "role": "registrar",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Good morning, Your Honours. This is case number IT-04-74-T, the Prosecutor versus Prlic et al. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] Thank you, Mr. Registrar. This Tuesday, 11 September 2007 we begin our hearing with an hour and a half delay because of a technical incident, a serious technical incident. This is the reason why we have one hour and a half delay. I will indicate to the Defence that the Chamber will give a decision at the end of the week concerning an expert witness Miller, the expert witness Miller. Therefore, the decision will be read out soon. I know that Defence has been awaiting it for some time. I would ask the registrar to go in closed session."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "is_accused": false,
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "to be reconvened on Wednesday, the 12th day of September, 2007, at 9.00 a.m."
    }
